{"id":"53a901d3f85d3dac","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-suslin-theorem.md","title":"Suslin Theorem for Relations","display":"thm-suslin-theorem — Suslin Theorem for Relations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-suslin-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-suslin-theorem"],"display":"thm-suslin-theorem — Suslin Theorem for Relations","depends_on":["[[68-df-borel-relation]]","[[68-thm-delta-projective-sigma-ring]]","[[68-thm-separation-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"20.5 p.78 / PDF 87","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-two-direction-argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-suslin-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-suslin-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-suslin-theorem — Suslin Theorem for Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0d1050ea9a023f8\" href=\"?note=c0d1050ea9a023f8\" title=\"68-thm-delta-projective-sigma-ring\">68-thm-delta-projective-sigma-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b92bd908c1baefd\" href=\"?note=2b92bd908c1baefd\" title=\"68-thm-separation-theorem\">68-thm-separation-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"20.5 p.78 / PDF 87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-two-direction-argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X_{m,k}\">\\(A\\subseteq X_{m,k}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}\\)</span> 沿用所列直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对 20.5 及其证明。递归生成族包含于粗体 Δ¹₁，20.3 证明后者为 σ-ring，故生成的 Borel 类也包含于其中。反向，A∈Δ¹₁ 保证 A 与其补集均为粗体 Σ¹₁；20.4 给出 Borel 分离集 C。由 A⊆C 且 X\\A⊆X\\C，必有 C=A。PDF87 的实际印刷证明写的是 Δ¹₁ in R relation，而非 Borel relation；这里依据 20.4 显式改用 Borel 分离集，作为本地勘误，避免循环使用本结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-delta-projective-sigma-ring","status":"resolved","id":"c0d1050ea9a023f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-delta-projective-sigma-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-separation-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-separation-theorem]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Delta_1^{1,(m,k)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8b8a34e241cffe0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-suslin-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["61df304a04864967","c0d1050ea9a023f8","2b92bd908c1baefd"]}